Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Topology Inventory Assembly

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a zero-effect composition that consumes complete output-only supplied root, directory, and regular-file topology carriers, retains their full lineage, and releases one bounded structurally closed supplied member set without claiming physical enumeration, inventory completeness, traversal, aggregate digest, receipt, or admission.

