& [PlanContract] is strict
  + exact profile, nonzero assembly identity, complete TopologyScanLimits, and 16384-byte predecode cap
  + serde denies unknown, missing, malformed, and mistyped fields
  + current ValidateTopologyForm is mandatory for limits
  - no entries, paths, counts, totals, digest, receipt, consistency, or provenance claim in plan

& [InputContract] requires complete output-only carriers
  + public assembly accepts exactly one WindowsSuppliedRootTopologyProjection by value
  + public assembly accepts owned vectors of WindowsSuppliedDirectoryTopologyProjection and WindowsSuppliedRegularFileTopologyProjection
  + no combined carrier JSON decoder exists because carriers intentionally do not derive Deserialize
  - never: accept raw TopologyEntryObservation, preflight fragment, stable pair, content binding, seed, or other lower success fragment

& [MemberContract] is closed and lineage preserving
  + WindowsSuppliedTopologyInventoryMember variants are Root, Directory, and RegularFile
  + every variant owns one complete corresponding carrier
  + member derives Serialize but not Deserialize or Default
  + immutable observation, projection-identity, and entry-reference access only
  + no raw-observation or lower-fragment conversion exists

& [EvaluationContract] is ordered
  + validate plan and limits
  + derive checked total cardinality and enforce maximum_entries before internal member-vector allocation
  + current-M2A-validate root and require exact root shape
  + current-M2A-validate every descendant and require carrier-specific kind
  + require all volume serials equal root exactly
  + reject duplicate projection identity, entry reference, complete strong identity, descendant path, and ordinal in that order
  + apply path, depth, stream, per-file, aggregate-byte, and arithmetic limits
  + require exact ancestor-directory closure
  + sort descendants by canonical structural comparator
  + require existing ordinals equal root-first contiguous positions
  + release one output-only assembly
  + first failure returns no partial success

& [CardinalityContract] is checked before growth
  + compute one plus both vector lengths with checked usize addition
  + require checked u64 representation and total within limits.maximum_entries
  + allocate internal member storage only after the bound passes
  - never: claim the function retroactively bounded allocations already made by its caller

& [ValidationContract] is current and honest
  + current ValidateTopologyForm runs on every projected observation
  + exact TopologyFormFault is nested only under topology_form
  + root is RootDirectory with None path and ordinal one
  + directory carrier remains Directory and regular-file carrier remains RegularFile
  - never: claim this composition reruns preflight, policy, stream parser, stability, hashing, binding, or carrier projection logic

& [IdentityContract] is exact supplied-set correlation
  + projection identities from carrier plans are globally unique
  + entry references from stable pairs or content-binding stable pairs are globally unique
  + complete StrongFileIdentity values are globally unique including root
  + every entry volume_serial equals root volume_serial exactly
  - never: treat any of these relations as physical origin, scan, volume, membership, or enumeration proof

& [PathAndParentContract] is exact supplied-set closure
  + descendant path Strings are globally unique across directory and regular-file members
  + every proper slash-separated prefix exists and has Directory kind
  + top-level entries use implicit root parent
  + comparisons preserve exact case, Unicode, and bytes
  - never: infer absent siblings, children, ignored entries, nested repositories, case-insensitive uniqueness, Git truth, or physical completeness

& [LimitContract] is structural
  + entry count, path UTF-8 bytes, slash-component depth, stream count, file length, and total regular-file bytes obey supplied current-valid limits
  + total uses checked u64 addition and directories contribute zero
  + deadline_tick remains declared syntax only because no clock is read

& [OrderContract] is one profile-specific structural comparator
  + root is always first
  + descendant paths split on existing forward slashes
  + corresponding components compare by raw UTF-8 bytes
  + an exhausted shorter component sequence sorts first
  + duplicate paths reject before comparison and no secondary tiebreaker exists
  + complete carrier members move together and nested values remain unchanged
  - never: describe this as physical traversal, Windows collation, Unicode normalization, case-insensitive order, or Git tree order

& [OrdinalContract] binds declarations without repair
  + root ordinal is exactly one
  + structurally ordered descendants require exact ordinals two through entry_count
  + checked position conversion and addition only
  - never: generate, repair, renumber, or cite ordinal coherence as traversal evidence

& [OutputContract] is nonforgeable
  + WindowsSuppliedTopologyInventoryAssembly has private profile, plan, ordered_members, entry_count, and total_file_bytes fields
  + derives Serialize but not Deserialize or Default
  + immutable getters only and no public constructor, public field, mutable getter, From, or Into
  + every input carrier occurs exactly once in ordered_members

& [FaultContract] is closed, bounded, nested, and atomic
  + codes are json, profile, assembly_identity, topology_form, cardinality, root_shape, carrier_kind, projection_identity, entry_reference, volume, strong_identity, relative_path, ordinal, limit, parent, order, arithmetic, and resource
  + field and message caps are 64 and 256 Unicode scalars
  + exact nested topology fault appears only under topology_form
  + no fault contains partial success or complete lower records

& [SemanticBoundary] is mandatory
  + success proves a supplied, current-M2A-revalidated, exact-correlated, structurally parent-closed member set only
  - never: claim runtime origin, physical root or membership, path existence, handle continuity, freshness, enumeration, inventory completeness, actual traversal, Git truth, canonical byte encoding, aggregate digest, double inventory, receipt, admission, mutation safety, or promotion authority

& [ImplementationBoundary] is zero effect
  + one module, one export, module tests, one independent static test, one evidence test, and governed closure
  + production imports only std collections, comparison and formatting, serde, current topology forms, and the three carrier modules
  + Cargo, lockfile, unsafe, Windows-call, filesystem, process, environment, clock, random, network, persistence, database, model, Git, fixture, traversal, digest, receipt, admission, mutation, sealing, cleanup, and promotion deltas are zero

& [RequirementSet] is M2B-SSTIA-001 through M2B-SSTIA-016

& [AcceptanceContract] requires exact source and SJS hashes, direct tests for every gate and mapping, focused and workspace debug and overflow-checked release, format, warnings-denied lint, release build, warnings-denied docs, dependency audit, clone-portable evidence, recursive closure, rollback, and zero physical execution

& [SJSProcessingTrace] is complete
  + source preserved; boundary delineated; sixteen requirements exploded; terms refined; constraints checked and reapplied; unsafe and redundant surface pruned; downstream growth seeded; ownership, identities, path order, cardinality, accounting, faults, and seven folds phase locked; justification, plan, registry, matrix, and slice separately recorded

